  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "奈米材料於能源與環境領域之應用",
    "sub_ename": "NANOMATERIALS FOR ENERGY AND ENVIRONMENTAL APPLICATIONS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹奈米材料應用在能源和環境領域之原理與進展。內容包括奈米材料設計、合成與分析，以及於污染淨化、環境/食品感測、潔淨能源、能源轉換、儲能等應用。使學生瞭解如何應用奈米技術解決能源和環境問題。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the principles and progress of nanomaterials for environment and energy applications. The content includes the design, synthesis, and analysis of nanomaterials, as well as their applications in environmental remediation/ decontamination, environmental/food sensing, clean energy, energy conversion, energy storage, etc. Students are expected to learn how to solve the environmental and energy problems by means of nanotechnology.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
