    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "奈米材料設計、合成與分析，以及於污染淨化、環境/食品感測、潔淨能源、能源轉換、儲能等應用。",
      "describe_en": "The design, synthesis, and analysis of nanomaterials, as well as their applications in environmental remediation/ decontamination, environmental/food sensing, clean energy, energy conversion, and energy storage, etc."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "使學生瞭解如何應用奈米技術解決能源和環境問題。",
      "describe_en": "Students are expected to learn how to solve the environmental and energy problems by means of nanotechnology."
    }
